section: rts
synopsis: Fix a deadlock when several threads call ``setNumCapabilities`` at the same time
issues: #28109
mrs: !MMMMM
description: {
``setNumCapabilities`` read the number of capabilities before it stopped the
world and released only that many afterwards.  When another call grew the
capability array in between, the capabilities it had added stayed owned by a
task that had already returned, and the next garbage collection (or any later
stop-the-world operation) waited for them forever.  The counts are now read
after the world is stopped, so every acquired capability is released.
}
